sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: A verifiable multi-agent handoff
    accDescr: A human gives a goal to an orchestrator, a worker returns output and evidence, an independent reviewer checks the original criteria, and bounded revisions lead to a decision packet.

    participant H as Human
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant W as Worker
    participant R as Independent reviewer

    H->>O: Goal, constraints, and authority
    O->>W: Scoped task, inputs, acceptance criteria, stop conditions
    W-->>O: Output, evidence, assumptions, open questions
    O->>R: Original criteria, output, and evidence
    R-->>O: Pass or prioritized findings
    alt Findings require revision and revision budget remains
        O->>W: Findings with unchanged acceptance criteria
        W-->>O: Revised output and evidence
        O->>R: Revised package
        R-->>O: Pass or escalate
    end
    O-->>H: Decision packet, evidence, and unresolved risks
